        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset SYLSQT, Sydney Square Rose Door Levers</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Kwikset Sydney Square rose door levers have a modern design with a unique shape that is ultra sleek making it an excellent choice for those who like a more minimalistic look. The Sydney is a non-handed lever which makes this item easy to install. Fits most pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" for door 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/sydney-lever-set-kwikset-sylrdt\"><b>Sydney Round Rose Door Lever</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Kwikset Square Rose Sydney Lever Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits most pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pick SmartKey system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed levers.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Square Rose Sydney Levers:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Lever Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2-5/8\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive lever for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational lever is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 lever and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Pushbutton on interior rose engages privacy lock on both levers; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Sydney Square Rose Lever Set, Kwikset SYLSQT",
                "description": "The Kwikset Sydney Square rose door levers have a modern design with a unique shape that is ultra sleek making it an excellent choice for those who like a more minimalistic look. The Sydney is a non-handed lever which makes this item easy to install. Fits most pre-drilled doors since it has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches for door 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. Available in dummy, passage, privacy and key entry functions.",
                "keywords": "KWI-SYLSQT Kwikset Square Rose Sydney Levers, Sydney Square Rose Lever Set, Kwikset SYLSQT Sydney Levers, kwikset 157SYLSQT dummy Levers, kwikset 154SYLSQT passage Levers, kwikset 155SYLSQT privacy Levers, kwikset 156SYLSQT keyed entry Levers, levers for doors, Halifax door lever sets, keyed door Lever locks, Kwikset door locks, contemporary door levers, Sydney modern door levers"
